lass="browser edge supported" role="img" aria-label="Edge check" style="box-sizing: border-box; display: flex;"></span></span><span class="engine" title="Supported in Firefox" style="box-sizing: border-box; background: var(--baseline-bg-secondary); border-radius: 2rem; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.5rem 0.625rem;"><span class="browser firefox supported" role="img" aria-label="Firefox check" style="box-sizing: border-box; display: flex;"></span></span><span class="engine" title="Supported in Safari" style="box-sizing: border-box; background: var(--baseline-bg-secondary); border-radius: 2rem; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.5rem 0.625rem;"><span class="browser safari supported" role="img" aria-label="Safari check" style="box-sizing: border-box; display: flex;"></span></span></div><span class="icon icon-chevron" style="box-sizing: border-box; background-color: var(--color-text-primary); display: inline-block; height: var(--chevron-size); -webkit-mask-position-x: center; -webkit-mask-position-y: center; mask-repeat: no-repeat; mask-size: contain; width: var(--chevron-size); mask-image: url(&quot;/static/client/chevron-down.7c923b7054da305b.svg&quot;); position: absolute; right: var(--chevron-padding-right);"></span></summary></span></details><section class="content-section" style="box-sizing: border-box; line-height: var(--font-line-content);"><p style="box-sizing: border-box;"><strong style="box-sizing: border-box;">Clipboard API</strong>는 클립보드 명령(잘라내기, 복사, 붙여넣기)에 응답하거나 시스템 클립보드에 비동기적으로 접근하고 쓸 수 있는 기능을 제공합니다.</p><div class="notecard note" style="box-sizing: border-box; background-color: var(--color-background-blue); border-inline-start: 2px solid var(--accent-color,var(--color-text-secondary)); border-radius: 0.25em; color: var(--color-text-primary); margin-block: 1em; padding-block: 1px; padding-inline: 3em 1em; position: relative; --accent-color: var(--color-text-blue);"><p style="box-sizing: border-box;"><strong style="box-sizing: border-box;">참고 :</strong><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>이 API는<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/API/Web_Workers_API" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: var(--color-link-visited); text-decoration: underline;">웹 워커</a>에서 사용할 수<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><strong style="box-sizing: border-box;">없습니다</strong>. (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/WorkerNavigator" class="only-in-en-us" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: var(--color-link-visited); text-decoration: underline;"><code style="box-sizing: border-box; background-color: var(--color-background-secondary); font-family: var(--font-family-code); border-radius: var(--radius-normal); padding: 0.125em 0.25em;">WorkerNavigator</code></a>에 노출되지 않음)</p></div><p style="box-sizing: border-box;">Clipboard API는<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/API/Document/execCommand" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: var(--color-link-visited); text-decoration: underline;"><code style="box-sizing: border-box; background-color: var(--color-background-secondary); font-family: var(--font-family-code); border-radius: var(--radius-normal); padding: 0.125em 0.25em;">document.execCommand()</code></a>를 사용한 클립보드 접근을 대체하기 위해 디자인되었습니다.</p></section></div><aside class="layout__right-sidebar reference-layout__toc" style="box-sizing: border-box; grid-row-start: right-sidebar; grid-column-start: right-sidebar; grid-row-end: right-sidebar; grid-column-end: right-sidebar; max-height: calc(100vh - var(--sticky-header-height)); outline-offset: -2px; overflow-y: auto; position: sticky; top: var(--sticky-header-height); margin-right: calc(var(--layout-side-padding-min)*-1); padding-left: var(--layout-sidebar-padding); padding-right: var(--layout-side-padding-min); place-content: start space-between; align-items: start; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem;"><nav class="reference-toc" style="box-sizing: border-box;"><h2 style="box-sizing: border-box; font-size: var(--toc-header-font-size,var(--font-size-large)); font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; padding: 0.75em 0px;">In this article</h2><ul style="box-sizing: border-box; display: grid; list-style: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px;"><li style="box-sizing: border-box;"><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/API/Clipboard_API#%ED%81%B4%EB%A6%BD%EB%B3%B4%EB%93%9C_%EC%A0%91%EA%B7%BC" data-glean-id="toc_click: #클립보드_접근" aria-current="true" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: inherit; box-shadow: -2px 0 0 var(--color-area-highlight-border); display: inline-block; margin-left: 2px; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; text-decoration: none; background-color: var(--color-area-background);">클립보드 접근</a></li><li style="box-sizing: border-box;"><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/API/Clipboard_API#%EC%9D%B8%ED%84%B0%ED%8E%98%EC%9D%B4%EC%8A%A4" data-glean-id="toc_click: #인터페이스" aria-current="true" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: inherit; box-shadow: -2px 0 0 var(--color-area-highlight-border); display: inline-block; margin-left: 2px; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; text-decoration: none; background-color: var(--color-area-background);">인터페이스</a></li><li style="box-sizing: border-box;"><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/API/Clipboard_API#%EB%AA%85%EC%84%B8" data-glean-id="toc_click: #명세" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: inherit; box-shadow: -2px 0 0 var(--color-border-primary); display: inline-block; margin-left: 2px; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; text-decoration: none;">명세</a></li><li style="box-sizing: border-box;"><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/API/Clipboard_API#%EB%B8%8C%EB%9D%BC%EC%9A%B0%EC%A0%80_%ED%98%B8%ED%99%98%EC%84%B1" data-glean-id="toc_click: #브라우저_호환성" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: inherit; box-shadow: -2px 0 0 var(--color-border-primary); display: inline-block; margin-left: 2px; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; text-decoration: none;">브라우저 호환성</a></li><li style="box-sizing: border-box;"><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/API/Clipboard_API#%EA%B0%99%EC%9D%B4_%EB%B3%B4%EA%B8%B0" data-glean-id="toc_click: #같이_보기" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: inherit; box-shadow: -2px 0 0 var(--color-border-primary); display: inline-block; margin-left: 2px; padding: 0.25em 0.5em; text-decoration: none;">같이 보기</a></li></ul></nav><mdn-placement-sidebar style="box-sizing: border-box;"></mdn-placement-sidebar></aside><div class="layout__body reference-layout__body" style="box-sizing: border-box; grid-row-start: body; grid-column-start: body; grid-row-end: body; grid-column-end: body; padding-bottom: 3rem;"><section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="클립보드_접근" style="box-sizing: border-box; line-height: var(--font-line-content);"><h2 id="클립보드_접근" class="heading" style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: var(--font-weight-normal); line-height: var(--font-line-header); margin: 1rem 0px 0px; font-size: var(--font-size-larger); caret-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;"><a class="heading-anchor" href="https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/API/Clipboard_API#%ED%81%B4%EB%A6%BD%EB%B3%B4%EB%93%9C_%EC%A0%91%EA%B7%BC" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: var(--color-link-visited); text-decoration: none;">클립보드 접근</a></h2><p style="box-sizing: border-box; caret-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;">시스템 클립보드에 접근할 땐<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code style="box-sizing: border-box; background-color: var(--color-background-secondary); font-family: var(--font-family-code); border-radius: var(--radius-normal); padding: 0.125em 0.25em;">Clipboard</code><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>객체의 인스턴스를 생성하지 않고, 전역<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/ko/docs/Web/API/Navigator/clipboard" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: var(--color-link-visited); text-decoration: underline;"><code style="box-sizing: border-box; background-color: var(--color-background-secondary); font-family: var(--font-family-code); border-radius: var(--radius-normal); padding: 0.125em 0.25em;">Navigator.clipboard</code></a>를 사용합니다.</p><mdn-code-example class="brush: js notranslate" style="box-sizing: border-box; display: block; margin: 1rem 0px; caret-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;"><div class="code-example" style="box-sizing: border-box; --border: 1px solid var(--color-border-primary); border: var(--border); border-radius: 0.25rem; overflow: hidden;"><div class="example-header" style="box-sizing: border-box; align-items: center; border-bottom: var(--border); display: flex; line-height: var(--font-line-ui); min-height: 3.1rem; padding: 0.5rem 0.5rem 0.5rem 1rem; gap: 0.5rem;"><span class="language-name" style="box-sizing: border-box; text-transform: uppercase; margin-right: auto;">JS</span><mdn-copy-button variant="secondary" style="box-sizing: border-box;"><mdn-button variant="secondary" style="display: inline-flex; vertical-align: middle;"><button class="button" part="button" aria-labelledby="label-domm08vkkg" data-variant="secondary" style="align-items: center; background-color: initial; border: 1px solid; border-radius: 0.25rem; color: var(--color-text-primary); column-gap: 0.3125em; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; font-family: var(--font-family-text); font-size: 0.875em; font-weight: 450; justify-content: center; line-height: var(--font-line-ui); margin: 0px; padding: 0.5em; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: middle; box-sizing: border-box; height: 33.5px; width: 52.734375px;"><span class="label" part="label" id="label-domm08vkkg" style="padding-block: 0.125em; padding-inline: 0.0625em;"><span style="display: contents;">Copy</span></span></button></mdn-button></mdn-copy-button></div><pre class="brush: js notranslate" style="box-sizing: border-box; background-color: var(--color-background-secondary); display: flex; margin: 0px; white-space: pre-wrap;"><code style="box-sizing: border-box; background-color: initial; flex-grow: 1; flex-shrink: 1; font-family: var(--font-family-code); overflow: auto; padding: 1rem;">navigator<span class="token punctuation" style="box-sizing: border-box; --csstools-light-dark-toggle-92f7e96b-1: var(--csstools-color-scheme--light) #b3b3b3; color: light-dark(rgb(81, 86, 93), rgb(179, 179, 179));">.</span>clipboard
  <span class="token punctuation" style="box-sizing: border-box; --csstools-light-dark-toggle-92f7e96b-1: var(--csstools-color-scheme--light) #b3b3b3; color: light-dark(rgb(81, 86, 93), rgb(179, 179, 179));">.</span><span class="token function" style="box-sizing: border-box; --csstools-light-dark-toggle-92f7e96b-2: var(--csstools-color-scheme--light) #ff97a0; color: light-dark(rgb(211, 0, 56), rgb(255, 151, 160));">readText</span><span class="token punctuation" style="box-sizing: border-box; --csstools-light-dark-toggle-92f7e96b-1: var(--csstools-color-scheme--light) #b3b3b3; color: light-dark(rgb(81, 86, 93), rgb(179, 179, 179));">(</span><span class="token punctuation" style="box-sizing: border-box; --csstools-light-dark-toggle-92f7e96b-1: var(--csstools-color-scheme--light) #b3b3b3; color: light-dark(rgb(81, 86, 93), rgb(179, 179, 179));">)</span>
  <span class="token punctuation" style="box-sizing: border-box; --csstools-light-dark-toggle-92f7e96b-1: var(--csstools-color-scheme--light) #b3b3b3; color: light-dark(rgb(81, 86, 93), rgb(179, 179, 179));">.</span><span class="token function" style="box-sizing: border-box; --csstools-light-dark-toggle-92f7e96b-2: var(--csstools-color-scheme--light) #ff97a0; color: light-dark(rgb(211, 0, 56), rgb(255, 151, 160));">then</span><span class="token punctuation" style="box-sizing: border-box; --csstools-light-dark-toggle-92f7e96b-1: var(--csstools-color-scheme--light) #b3b3b3; color: light-dark(rgb(81, 86, 93), rgb(179, 179, 179));">(</span>
    <span class="token punctuation" style="box-sizing: border-box; --csstools-light-dark-toggle-92f7e96b-1: var(--csstools-color-scheme--light) #b3b3b3; color: light-dark(rgb(81, 86, 93), rgb(179, 179, 179));">(</span><span class="token parameter" style="box-sizing: border-box;">clipText</span><span class="token punctuation" style="box-sizing: border-box; --csstools-light-dark-toggle-92f7e96b-1: var(--csstools-color-scheme--light) #b3b3b3; color: light-dark(rgb(81, 86, 93), rgb(179, 179, 179));">)</span> <span class="token operator" style="box-sizing: border-box;">=&gt;</span> <span class="token punctuation" style="box-sizing: border-box; --csstools-light-dark-toggle-92f7e96b-1: var(--csstools-color-scheme--light) #b3b3b3; color: light-dark(rgb(81, 86, 93), rgb(179, 179, 179));">(</span>document<span class="token punctuation" style="box-sizing: border-box; --csstools-light-dark-toggle-92f7e96b-1: var(--csstools-color-scheme--light) #b3b3b3; color: light-dark(rgb(81, 86, 93), rgb(179, 179, 179));">.</span><span class="token function" style="box-sizing: border-box; --csstools-light-dark-toggle-92f7e96b-2: var(--csstools-color-scheme--light) #ff97a0; color: light-dark(rgb(211, 0, 56), rgb(255, 151, 160));">querySelector</span><span class="token punctuation" style="box-sizing: border-box; --csstools-light-dark-toggle-92f7e96b-1: var(--csstools-color-scheme--light) #b3b3b3; color: light-dark(rgb(81, 86, 93), rgb(179, 179, 179));">(</span><span class="token string" style="box-sizing: border-box; --csstools-light-dark-toggle-92f7e96b-5: var(--csstools-color-scheme--light) #00d061; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 121, 54), rgb(0, 208, 97));">".editor"</span><span class="token punctuation" style="box-sizing: border-box; --csstools-light-dark-toggle-92f7e96b-1: var(--csstools-color-scheme--light) #b3b3b3; color: light-dark(rgb(81, 86, 93), rgb(179, 179, 179));">)</span><span class="token punctuation" style="box-sizing: border-box; --csstools-light-dark-toggle-92f7e96b-1: var(--csstools-color-scheme--light) #b3b3b3; color: light-dark(rgb(81, 86, 93), rgb(179, 179, 179));">.</span>innerText <span class="token operator" style="box-sizing: border-box;">+=</span> clipText<span class="token punctuation" style="box-sizing: border-box; --csstools-light-dark-toggle-92f7e96b-1: var(--csstools-color-scheme--light) #b3b3b3; color: light-dark(rgb(81, 86, 93), rgb(179, 179, 179));">)</span><span class="token punctuation" style="box-sizing: border-box; --csstools-light-dark-toggle-92f7e96b-1: var(--csstools-color-scheme--light) #b3b3b3; color: light-dark(rgb(81, 86, 93), rgb(179, 179, 179));">,</span>
  <span class="token punctuation" style="box-sizing: border-box; --csstools-light-dark-toggle-92f7e96b-1: var(--csstools-color-scheme--light) #b3b3b3; color: light-dark(rgb(81, 86, 93), rgb(179, 179, 179));">)</span><span class="token punctuation" style="box-sizing: border-box; --csstools-light-dark-toggle-92f7e96b-1: var(--csstools-color-scheme--light) #b3b3b3; color: light-dark(rgb(81, 86, 93), rgb(179, 179, 179));">;</span>
</code></pre></div></mdn-code-example><p style="box-sizing: border-box; caret-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Inter, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: auto; text-decoration-style: solid;">위의 코드 조각은 클립보드에서 텍스트를 가져와서,<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><code style="box-sizing: border-box; background-color: var(--color-background-secondary); font-family: var(--font-family-code); border-radius: var(--radius-normal); padding: 0.125em 0.25em;">editor</code><span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span>클래스를 가진 첫 번째 요소의 콘텐츠 뒤에 추가합니다.<span class="Apple-converted-space"> </span><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Clipboard/readText" title="readText()" class="only-in-en-us" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: var(--color-link-visited); text-decoration: underline;"><code style="box-sizing: border-box; background-color: var(--color-background-secondary); font-family: var(--font-family-code); border-radius: var(--radius-normal); padding: 0.125em 0.25em;">readText()</code></a>는 (<a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Clipboard/read" title="read()" class="only-in-en-us" style="box-sizing: border-box; color: var(--color-link-visited); text-decoration: underline;"><code style="box-sizing: border-box; background-color: var(--color-background-secondary); font-family: var(--font-family-code); border-radius: var(--radius-normal); padding: 0.125em 0.25em;">read()</code></a>도 마찬가지로) 클립보드의 내용이 텍스트가 아니면 빈 문자열을 반환하므로, 이 코드는 안전합니다.</p>